{"mapId":100542643,"appId":"1","authorId":283438108155232,"title":"小猫矿工v15","cover":"https://assets.box3.fun/content/_6kI4Euunb-X22ifX3QZMwx0uChPvtkW3Fbt8CZvRR4.png","description":"挖矿探索：左键长按挖掘各类矿物（40 + 种），不同矿物对应不同硬度和经验值，不可破坏方块（如深色火山岩）无法挖掘。\n资源管理：挖掘的矿物自动存入背包，可通过下蹲键打开背包，查看矿物数量、价格，一键变卖换金币。\n成长体系：挖矿积累经验，解锁 100 级称号（从 “挖矿学徒” 到 “矿道至尊”），经验计入全局排名，支持查看前 50 名战绩。\n辅助道具：商店可购买火把（右键放置、左键回收）、挖掘加速、矿物探测仪等道具，提升挖矿效率。\n数据存档：背包、金币、经验、称号、火把库存均自动存档，下次登录不丢失。","notice":"新增矿洞争霸","version":24,"publishedAt":"2026-02-06T22:27:13.436","updateAt":"2026-02-06T22:27:13.436","playHash":"9712f5a2badcf729b476","onlineCount":0,"playCount":5752,"favoritesCount":106,"commentCount":113,"viewCount":7529,"likeCount":81,"mediaResourcesHash":["https://assets.box3.fun/content/a1ty7cFHEvPm2T9lVSroRhSgeqHofYjoBbEai6U5lPQ.png","https://assets.box3.fun/content/emimSkDmkmzTG43buI-rZARrZ-HsdIe5ew3-Uh-PASA.png","https://assets.box3.fun/content/6sqvvbGd6mfty1JjUKl0hr-JsLSSKy7h9iQtNjlbPmk.png"],"labels":[{"labelId":3,"labelName":"原创","labelKey":"original"}],"currentReleaseVersion":24,"combType":1,"weight":0,"teamable":true,"_tab":"mapPopular"}